      "writtenOn": "2022-09-02T07:45:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the pointer! Actually the option `-a` is supposed to follow AOSP style instead of Google style.\n\nAre there any scripts that can run checkstyle aosp lint easily?\n\nOtherwise, I think it can be good to have some pre-submit cl formatter for java. Currently the java linter only checks unused import and some obvious indent issues.",
