      "writtenOn": "2022-09-02T08:17:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, checkstyle gets run at repo upload time, which is almost exactly the wrong time.\n\nI think you can run the preupload checks without running repo via `~/android/master/tools/repohooks/pre-upload.py` (there\u0027s a README in that directory). But that\u0027s not much better.\n\nWhat I do is use IntelliJ, which has an AndroidStyle style plugin that seems to do the right thing automatically as you edit, mostly.\n\nIt\u0027s also supported by aidegen.",
